  "title": "· New Arrival | Prada Unveils the Chérie Bag: A Nylon Lunchbox Icon ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Prada 上架新款 Chérie 手袋：尼龙饭盒包",
  "excerpt": "Prada’s Fall 2026 Chérie bag pairs recycled nylon with playful details, offering a compact, versatile companion for everyday style.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-08-06",
