    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For Fall 2026, Prada introduces its latest handbag creation—the “Chérie.” Crafted from the brand’s signature Re-Nylon regenerated nylon, this compact lunch-box silhouette is elevated with a top metal clasp, enamel triangle logo, leather handles, and a detachable shoulder strap, blending utilitarian chic with a playful spirit. The name “Chérie,” meaning “dear” in French, reflects its role as a close companion for your everyday.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
