    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Metal Clasp ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Chérie line debuts in two designs: one with a top metal clasp and another with stud snap buttons. Both versions feature the lightweight, eco-friendly Re-Nylon fabric paired with tonal leather trim, showcasing a clean and practical lunch-box outline. The top metal clasp adds a touch of outdoor sportiness, while the enameled metal triangle logo proudly asserts the brand’s identity.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
