    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The metal clasp version is offered in four colorways: peony pink, water silver, ivy green, and black. It comes with an adjustable handle and a detachable, adjustable shoulder strap, allowing for hand, elbow, shoulder, or crossbody carry. Its compact, lightweight construction exudes timeless elegance.",
