    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The stud snap version of the Chérie bag presents a sleek, streamlined silhouette. The snap closure allows you to adjust the handle length, while the detachable shoulder strap offers versatile carrying options. Available in five classic, versatile shades—burgundy, cognac, ochre brown, black with gold hardware, and black with silver hardware—these timeless colors are designed to accompany you through every season.",
